# Stoic Grove-Guide: "{1}{B/G}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black and green Elf creature token. Activate only
# as a sorcery." Entomb puts it in Bot1's graveyard turn 1, where Bot2's own Grove-Guide stays put (Bot2's graveyard is not
# Bot1's). Red and white mana cannot pay the hybrid {B/G}; on Bot2's turn the ability is a sorcery's, so green and blue mana
# cannot activate it; on turn 3 black and red mana do: the card is exiled and one 2/2 black and green Elf token arrives.

